{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "IIYRRGNQHUNJKD52R5KMYGHEUFW6VMTP",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "041118005",
    "title": "見せたのは、彼女への笑顔",
    "enTitle": "Flashing a Smile",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "アドマイヤグルーヴと契約してから、しばらく。\nトレーニングも順調に進んでいたが……。",
            "enText": "I have been Admire Groove's trainer for a while now, \nand while training is going well…",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 99,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -6128105752274322653,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "はっ、はっ……ふー……。",
            "enText": "<i>Hah</i>… <i>haah</i>… <i>phoooh</i>…",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 162,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "よし、次の予定は坂路で――",
                    "enText": "Great, let's move on to the slope and ——",
                    "nextBlock": 3
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 152,
                    "pathId": 3967682666724359717
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 187,
                    "pathId": -1600634964150084316
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -974857047303190098,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……トレーニングメニューは、頭に入っています。\nいちいち言わなくて構いません。",
            "enText": "I <i>know</i> the regimen, you don't need to \nremind me every single time.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 203,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 264,
                    "pathId": -504959037373890192
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": 6426955979793054614
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7696395053338592469,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "……相変わらず、アドマイヤグルーヴから\n放たれるのは、辛辣な言葉と拒絶の態度だった。",
            "enText": "…Her harsh words and distancing have become \ncommonplace to me as well now.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 99,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 113,
                    "pathId": -7335392614583891265
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 121309724806615631,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "先輩トレーナー",
            "enName": "Senior Trainer",
            "jpText": "お前んとこは、相変わらずだな～。\nいやほんと、お疲れさん……。",
            "enText": "You two haven't made much progress, eh? \nHahah, better you than me…",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 196,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 2713156893547273489,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "同期のトレーナー",
            "enName": "Contemporary Trainer",
            "jpText": "毎度あんな態度をとられてたら、\n私なら心折れてるかも……その、大丈夫？",
            "enText": "If I were in your shoes, I don't think I'd be able to take \nher constant cold treatment… Are you holding up okay?",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 252,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -7368329105586793193,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "これまでのやり取りを何度か目にしていたらしく、\n心配した先輩と同僚が話しかけてくれる。",
            "enText": "The other trainers, elders and contemporaries alike, strike up \nconversation sometimes, having looked upon many of these \nexchanges before with some degree of worry.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 101,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 6461498743064387038,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "だが、心配は必要ない。むしろ、彼女の懸命な走りを見ていると、\nもっと頑張ろうという気持ちにさせられるくらいだ。",
            "enText": "But while I appreciate their concern, it is unneeded. \nIf anything, I gain more motivation whenever I see \nhow earnestly she works on her running. ",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 116,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 179,
                    "pathId": -2395763862417097267
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 967082220950844374,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……はっ……はっ……。",
            "enText": "…<i>Hahh</i>… <i>haah</i>…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 177,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 188,
                    "pathId": 8462967233074705668
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8696464920131539376,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……――",
            "enText": "……",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 74,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 85,
                    "pathId": 8583411567103466303
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -2838538382327945080
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8494501250203430346,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……っ、はっ……！",
            "enText": "……<i>Hm</i>. <i>Hahh</i>…!",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 99,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 25,
                    "pathId": -514622345420744218
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1538951671860298665,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "……が。心配してくれる仲間たちが寄ってくるたびに、\nアドマイヤグルーヴから更に距離をとられているような気がする。",
            "enText": "The only thing is… I get the feeling that whenever trainers \napproach me like that, Admire Groove further distances \nherself from me.",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 118,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（よくはないよな……）",
                    "enText": "(Well, that's not good…)",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "（よくはないよね……）",
                    "enText": "(Well, that's not good…)",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 129,
                    "pathId": 91084742958518872
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8895855292782749534,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "心配してくれる仲間を突き放すことはできない。かといって、\n現状、アドマイヤグルーヴのメンタルにもよくない。",
            "enText": "I can't just push my colleagues away when they so kindly \nreach out to me in support. On the other hand, I can't have \nthis affecting Admire Groove's mental state.",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 114,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 131,
                    "pathId": 8101542570258982490
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7257778433758770870,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "ふっ、ふー……。",
            "enText": "<i>Hahh</i>… <i>pheh</i>… <i>phew</i>…",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 137,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": 1740784520105366663
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 117,
                    "pathId": 3004215688478360422
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6348461632731282862,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……。\n……なにを、ボーッとしているのですか。",
            "enText": "……Enjoying the view?",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 166,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 245,
                    "pathId": 6022588439360800411
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": 8636250252886438583
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 744783895571681290,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "集中を欠いているのでしたら、帰って休まれてはいかがですか。\n今日やることは全て決定済みですし、私ひとりでも進められます。",
            "enText": "If you can't keep your head in it, why don't you go home \nand take a nap. Today's regimen is all set already anyway, \nI can run trough it on my own.",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 352,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "いや、ごめん！大丈夫、やれるよ",
                    "enText": "No, I'm sorry! I'm good. Ready anytime!",
                    "nextBlock": 17
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -6256273058587341070
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3296991882656563136,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "…………。\n私は、次に行きますから。貴方は好きにしてください。",
            "enText": "……I'll continue with the next training item. \nYou can do whatever you like.",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 228,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "あっ",
                    "enText": "Ah…",
                    "nextBlock": 18
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 123,
                    "pathId": 9099272389275980972
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -43611035054342523,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "……とにかく、目の前のことに集中しよう。こちらが努力すれば、\nいつか関係もよくなり、周りにもわかってもらえるだろう。",
            "enText": "…Let me just focus on what's right in front of me first. \nIf I put in the work, our relationship will eventually improve \nand everyone else will begin to understand, I'm sure.",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 120,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -6724498799763776217,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "そこの飲み物を用意してくださったの、貴方ですよね？\n必要ないと伝えたはずですが。",
            "enText": "Were you the one who left me this drink? \nI told you you needn't bother.",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 244,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ついでだよ、ついで！",
                    "enText": "I just happened to be thirsty myself, is all!",
                    "nextBlock": 20
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 360,
                    "pathId": 1330533925070293023
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 8774397897722465644
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -345441245105928417,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "…………。",
            "enText": "……",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 76,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 74,
                    "pathId": 5100428067790810250
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6509357503850710377,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "大したことじゃない、当たり前のことだとアピールする。\n他愛のない親切を、彼女が自然に受け入れられるように。",
            "enText": "I decided to try playing acts like this off as completely normal, \nsomething trivial, in the hopes that she'll gradually learn to \naccept these tiny little bits of kindness.",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 114,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 141,
                    "pathId": 1422709333285602409
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4297430914266685722,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "自主トレまで、様子を見に来る必要はありません。\n……私は、ひとりでも問題ないので。",
            "enText": "There's no need for you to come observe my solo training. \n…I'll be fine by myself.",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 216,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "うん、了解！",
                    "enText": "Okay, you're the boss!",
                    "nextBlock": 23
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -7825617798742980835
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6729158759590945945,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……。\n…………。",
            "enText": "………",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 185,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 4679994275040378085
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 724019372788121546
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5186596792026513043,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "拒絶であっても問題はない。大丈夫だと笑顔で返す。\nこちらが悲嘆することはないと思ってもらえたら、成功だ。",
            "enText": "Being pushed away is no problem. I'll simply acknowledge \nher with a smile. If I can get her to feel that it doesn't get \nme down, that's all I need.",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 112,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 144,
                    "pathId": 4389289012993290522
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 169,
                    "pathId": 5271080159293832432
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5004082801419040569,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "明日のトレーニングについては、メニューを置いておいてほしいと\n申し上げたはずですが。口頭での説明は不要です。",
            "enText": "I believe I asked you to leave tomorrow's training regimen \nout for me. I don't need a verbal explanation.",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 281,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "わかった、何かあれば聞いてー！",
                    "enText": "Understood, just ask if you have questions!",
                    "nextBlock": 26
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": -6565848536818675957
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": 9138988990032207775
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 420,
                    "pathId": -1927961752807487368
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4892923129246015157,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……。なんなんです。先日から、ずっとヘラヘラと。\nバカにしているんですか？",
            "enText": "…What <i>has</i> come over you? You've been acting so frivolously \nthe past few days. Are you ridiculing me or something? ",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 296,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "えっ、いや、そんなつもりでは",
                    "enText": "Huh? No, I don't mean to ——",
                    "nextBlock": 27
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": -7781842320417692791
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5683739568890252023,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "……しまった、自分なりの努力が裏目に出てしまったのだろうか。\n慌てて、バカにしているつもりはないと否定する。",
            "enText": "…Uh-oh. Are my efforts backfiring? Perhaps I tried too hard. \nIn a panic, I try to assure her I'm definitely not ridiculing her.",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 115,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 303,
                    "pathId": -2167696017097339779
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8334307668952709102,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "違うのであれば、なにがそんなに嬉しいのか……\n理解に苦しみます。",
            "enText": "If not that, then I struggle to understand \nwhy you look so strangely happy…",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 198,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 303,
                    "pathId": 3876866128041735743
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 9056629476694059985,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "それとも、コミュニケーションのおつもりですか？\n笑顔ひとつで、変わるものなどないのに。",
            "enText": "Or is this some attempt at bonding? \nAs if that vapid smile would help anything.",
            "nextBlock": 30,
            "origClipLength": 270,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……したいから、してるだけだよ",
                    "enText": "…I'm only doing this because I want to!",
                    "nextBlock": 30
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 473,
                    "pathId": -5526753377020422702
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1376857228270012737,
            "blockIdx": 29
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……。\n……私には、必要ありません。",
            "enText": "……I am not in need of whatever you are doing.",
            "nextBlock": 31,
            "origClipLength": 247,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 94,
                    "pathId": 563021085292464073
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -5780543471900454279
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 52,
                    "pathId": 7066677884167406266
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7450662969835004240,
            "blockIdx": 30
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "こうして、彼女の言葉に笑顔で対応していた結果、\n先輩や同僚からは――",
            "enText": "To make matters worse, my attempts at responding to her \nwith a smile had gone down awkwardly with my colleagues…",
            "nextBlock": 32,
            "origClipLength": 89,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -6178341142840678758,
            "blockIdx": 31
        },
        {
            "jpName": "先輩トレーナー",
            "enName": "Senior Trainer",
            "jpText": "お前って、つらく当たられるのが……その、好きなタイプ？\nま、まぁ、お前が嬉しいなら、それでいいんだけどな。",
            "enText": "Hey, uh, are you… into that kinda cold treatment type? \nN-Not that it's my business, s'long as you're enjoying it…",
            "nextBlock": 33,
            "origClipLength": 315,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "pathId": 401208948385144757,
            "blockIdx": 32
        },
        {
            "jpName": "同期のトレーナー",
            "enName": "Contemporary Trainer",
            "jpText": "ほ、本人が楽しくできるのが一番だもんね！\n大丈夫、応援してるよっ。",
            "enText": "Y-Yeah! Whatever makes you happy! \nDon't worry, we won't judge.",
            "nextBlock": 34,
            "origClipLength": 196,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ち、違う！！違うから！！",
                    "enText": "H-Hang on!? Nooooo……!!",
                    "nextBlock": 34
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6374759914100194850,
            "blockIdx": 33
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "辛辣で冷たい言葉で喜んでいるなどと、\nあらぬ誤解をされてしまったのだった……。",
            "enText": "That was not the kind of understanding I was looking for…",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "origClipLength": 95,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 2771443783056732499,
            "blockIdx": 34
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1777037554,
    "humanTl": true
}